WEBVTT

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:06.060
Here's the application
for the School Idol Festival.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.980
Please go ahead with the approval.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:13.030
Hm... This sounds like
a very interesting proposal.

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:13.950
Yes.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.450
We're planning to make it an event
that all school idol fans can enjoy.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.160
Um.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.750
Pardon me. I apologize
if I'm being a bit out of touch,

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.460
but what exactly is a school idol?

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:32.550
They're cute and full
of energy. Just like me!

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:42.930
Normal students perform
as idols as a club activity.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.390
You seem rather knowledgeable
on the subject, President.

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:47.350
Huh?!

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:50.320
Well, I am the student council president.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.200
I need to take after the president
and research more.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.870
Regarding your application,

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:02.580
the details seem rather obscure,
so we won't be able to approve this as is.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:06.420
First, it doesn't list which schools
you'll be working with.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:09.630
We would also like a basic list
of activities you're planning.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:12.000
We'd also like to see a progress report.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.340
Most importantly,

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:16.720
we need to know where you're
proposing to hold this event.

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:20.930
Then if we do all that,
will you approve the application?

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:22.060
Yes.

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:25.810
Okay! The early bird gets
the worm, Yu-senpai!

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:26.810
Yup.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:29.230
Please excuse us.

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:34.940
A festival that...

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.740
...all school idol fans can enjoy...

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:42.280
I hope it turns out to be a lovely concert.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:45.910
Yes! Thank you very much.

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:52.590
All right, things are going to get busy!

00:01:53.960 --> 00:02:00.180
<i>Let's go to the future!</i>
<i>Rainbow melodies</i>

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:12.940
<i>The rain clears up and reveals blue skies</i>

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:15.940
<i>The winds of hope blow (Blowing)</i>

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:20.910
<i>We can feel something coming</i>
<i>and we take our very first step</i>

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.620
<i>The world is sparkling</i>

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.620
<i>And our hearts start to
well up with (Feelings)</i>

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:31.000
<i>"We want to start running right now!!"</i>
<i>(Move on! Move on!)</i>

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:36.510
<i>The tiny melodies blend together (Our Colors)</i>

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.720
<i>Let's paint this arch, now</i>

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:42.300
<i>It resonates throughout the city</i>
<i>(Reaching for far blue sky!)</i>

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.470
<i>Let's sing together!</i>

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:50.270
<i>My feelings are overflowing,</i>
<i>there's no stopping them now</i>

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.940
<i>Rainbow-colored passions!!</i>

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:55.150
<i>Colors painted in courage</i>

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.820
<i>Let's create a bridge to the future</i>

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:01.280
<i>Beyond the endless sky</i>

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.620
<i>Resounding sympathy</i>

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.990
<i>Miracles are blooming</i>

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.200
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards
the future, melodies</i>

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.620
<i>--Yes, I know I'm not alone</i>

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.290
<i>You're all always by my side</i>

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:20.340
<i>So let's connect our dreams together</i>

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:29.390
I see. I figured the process would be
super easy since Setsuna-chan was there,

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:32.100
but I guess not.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:36.230
I'm terribly sorry.
I got ahead of myself, as well.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:41.030
But they were nice enough to
point out everything we need to do.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.490
I'll help out, too, Yu-chan.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:48.910
Thanks. But all of you are busy
getting ready for the festival.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.710
This concert will be a dream
come true for all of us.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.870
We want to create it together.

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:57.750
I'm sure we'll be able to do even
the difficult parts if we work together.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.420
When does this all need to be done?

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.760
As long as we can make it by
the student council meeting next week.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:08.010
I think the first thing we have to
figure out is the venue.

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:14.310
Heya! Thanks for coming to my concert today!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.940
Ai've been dying to meet you all!
You know, since my name is Ai.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.650
Ai-chan!

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.280
Um...

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.610
Man, you get so hyped
from being on the stage!

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.700
I totally get it, Ai-chan.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:33.500
As soon as I stand on the stage,
my eyes start to close...

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.670
She just falls asleep as she's talking.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:41.090
I'd prefer it if we were closer to the fans.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:44.050
Then let's check out
the other possible venues, too.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.780
<i>Buono!</i> That tired feeling from
all that walking is gone in an instant!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:07.200
We did look around quite a bit.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.620
I'd love to sing in the middle of nature.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.000
Isn't it lovely performing as we listen
to the sound of the wind and waves?

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:18.670
I think this is my top pick
out of the places we saw today.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:22.420
I mean, this was where we were
supposed to have our debut concert.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:26.090
So I wanted to perform here at least once.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:28.760
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:33.020
I'd love to perform in
the middle of the city.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:35.730
All of you have completely
different answers, as usual.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:38.690
Well, let's keep looking for now.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:39.690
Okay!

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:47.610
Have you been doing your
summer vacation homework?

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:50.910
Yup. I'm almost done with
classical lit and math.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.830
Way to go, Ayumu. I haven't
even touched mine.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:58.290
You usually do all of it on the last day.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.330
Oh, here it comes.

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:03.630
Well, I'll head to the club room
after the meeting.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.510
Sure. See you later.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:17.730
Well, what do you think?

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:21.810
Would you be willing to participate
in the School Idol Festival?

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:26.570
I would love to! Sis told me about it,
so I was looking forward to it.

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:31.120
I also think it's a great idea.
It sounds like it'd be a lot of fun.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:34.790
And just thinking about standing on
the same stage as Karin-san again...

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.750
I'd be honored.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:43.500
Well, I'm honored that
you think so highly of me.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.380
She's a huge fan of yours, Karin-san.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.470
M-Misaki-san!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.590
Oh... Is that so?

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.970
I wish you would've told me earlier.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.980
Whoa, there.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.860
I think this is a great idea, too.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:11.240
A festival that all school idol
fans can enjoy sounds really exciting.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:13.530
I think it's great, too.

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:17.290
I won't be able to make a formal decision
until I talk to the other members,

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.870
but I'm sure everyone at Shinonome Academy
would like to participate, as well.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:24.460
Touou Academy will also proceed
with the intent of participating.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.260
Thank you very much!

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:32.010
What does the schedule look like?

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.390
I'm figuring that out with Setsuna-chan.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:37.890
I guess our biggest hurdle
still is finding the venue.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.390
All of them are so nice.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.150
It's really hard to narrow it down to one.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.230
Where would you like to perform, Ayumu?

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.280
I'm not exactly sure.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.320
Leave this to Kasumin!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.120
Ta-dah!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.500
I-It's so cute!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.160
What is that, Kasumi-chan?

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.960
I call it the Kasumin Box.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:07.880
Kasumin Box?

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:11.630
I asked people where they'd
like to see me perform!

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:15.840
Always listening to the words
of my fans who support me.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.510
That's the kind of idol I'd like to...

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:23.890
Kasumi-chan?

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.570
Wait, there's nothing?

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.950
--Why isn't there a single one in here?!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.200
--Well, it is summer vacation,

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.740
so only certain people
will show up to school.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.950
Yu-senpai!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:44.540
--I'm so sad!
--There, there...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:49.170
But the idea of a Kasumin Box is pretty fun.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:52.460
Yes, it's really cute.

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:57.010
Of course, it is! It's Kasumin's
Kasumin Box, after all!

00:08:57.010 --> 00:09:01.270
Well, while we're at it, why don't we ask
for opinions on other things, too?

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.980
What about this?

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:07.100
"We're getting ready to do
a School Idol Festival!
Tell us what kind of festival you'd like to see!"

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.570
It's very easy to understand.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.280
I'll go set it out there right now.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:13.570
Hey, wait!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:14.820
--But then you won't be able to
see my cute little face!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.320
--Oh, right.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.490
--It's summer vacation right now.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:20.740
We need everyone to find out about this.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.670
Heya!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.460
We made some cookies in the Baking Club.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.170
"Niji"

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:35.420
We made some cookies in the Baking Club.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:38.470
The School Idol Club gave us inspiration.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.100
Let's eat them together!

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.600
Everyone...

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:45.890
So you're having a festival? I had no idea.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:50.730
I wanted as many people to know about it
as possible, so I was making a site for it.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.400
It's good.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.360
Thank goodness.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:10:01.410
Hey, can I tell my friends about the festival?
I'm sure they'd be really happy.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.950
What's wrong?

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:10.080
We haven't gotten permission
from the student council yet.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:14.420
Oh, right. Sorry about that.
I was just so happy.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:23.430
Actually, go ahead and tell them.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.520
Are you sure, Rina-chan?

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:29.270
Yup. We'll do everything we can
to make sure the festival happens.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:33.270
So I hope you look forward to it.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:34.860
Thank you!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.900
You've got this, Rina-chan!

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.410
Rina-chan Board, determined.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.160
By the way, where's Ai-senpai?

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:51.670
Ah, so that's why you wanted to
test out these prototypes.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.750
Well...

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:58.340
Ai-san and the others are building up
their stamina for the festival.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.640
Cute little Kasumin's coming through!

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:09.890
Yu--

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:48.600
Ayumu. Ayumu.

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:59.610
Yu-chan...

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.530
You could've headed home without me.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:08.450
But I knew you hadn't gone home yet.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:14.080
And if this was the other way around,
you'd wait to go home, too, wouldn't you?

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:19.250
Yeah, I guess I would.
Thanks for waiting for me.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.170
You're welcome.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:27.890
Setsuna-chan's been helping me out,
so I got pretty far on that application.

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.390
That's great.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.640
Setsuna-chan didn't want
to walk home with us?

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.900
She said she still had some work to do.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.570
I see.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.570
We're turning in the
application tomorrow, right?

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:49.540
Yeah... And we've been talking about
narrowing down the venue to one,

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:52.160
but I keep wondering if
that'll be enough for all of you

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.870
to put on a concert just the way you want it.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.380
I keep thinking about it.

00:12:56.380 --> 00:13:01.920
Well, we, Shinonome,
and Touou all have different colors

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:06.220
so it's really difficult making
everyone's desires come true.

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:21.360
Everyone... Everyone, huh?

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.240
What should we do about the venue?

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:29.370
Realistically, our best option
would be the auditorium.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.870
But then we wouldn't be able to...

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.330
Th-There's been an incident!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.540
This is an emergency!

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.420
I've taken a look at your application.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.710
It appears as though you've
made some progress.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:44.760
Yes.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.300
It appears as though you haven't
written down a venue yet.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:51.100
We kept talking about that as a club.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:55.140
Where could we put on this concert
so that everyone could enjoy it?

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:58.020
But this wasn't the right direction.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.020
What do you mean?

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.520
Take a look at this.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:03.360
What's this?

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:06.240
Apparently, news about the festival
spread by word of mouth.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:09.990
And so many people left us messages!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:12.280
Messages?

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.160
There are so many...

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.250
"Kanata-chan's songs"...

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.960
..."always cheer me up.

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.090
Thanks to her, we made it to the Inter-High.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:29.180
If you have the festival,
I'd love to help out in some way."

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:32.470
"Emma-san's PV helps me decompress every day.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.770
We have a lot of outfits
we'd love for you to wear,

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:38.350
so I hope the festival becomes a reality."

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:43.730
"We love the School Idol Club so much
that we made cookies of them.

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:47.900
If the festival happens,
I hope everyone will have some."

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:51.990
After reading the messages,
we decided to talk.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:58.160
We tried to figure out what exactly a festival
that all school idol fans can enjoy is...

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.670
And then, we thought...

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:03.170
It's not just about holding the concert.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.460
It's not?

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.420
Yes, exactly.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:11.640
I mean, rather than just
making our dreams come true,

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:18.100
it'd be way more fun to make the wishes
of all our supporters come true, too.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.690
We actually got a lot of
requests for the venue,

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.980
and that's why we won't be
narrowing it down to one.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.440
We're going to be performing at all of them.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:32.530
We want to involve everyone from the city,
and make it a festival.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.990
Various idols will hold their concerts
at the venue they want

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:37.370
so they can do the show their own way.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:44.130
And the people who love school idols
will be able to express their love.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:48.630
A place where we gather everyone's wishes
and make them come true.

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:53.930
A festival that fits the School Idol Club
that everyone fell in love with...

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.260
And I think this is it.

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.020
I see.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:05.190
A festival that all
school idol fans can enjoy...

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:08.320
Yes! Isn't it exciting?

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:11.950
Very well.

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:15.450
President, I have nothing more to add.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.530
What do you think, President?

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:23.120
Yes, I think it's a lovely idea.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:25.210
"Approved"

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:28.590
Yay! We did it!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.340
Yeah!

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.340
Thank you very much!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:36.640
I... also want to participate now.

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.010
Does that mean...?

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:42.850
You see, after the other day,
I started researching school idols.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:43.730
So...

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:47.020
I totally understand! You just fall in love
when you see them, right?

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:48.980
So who do you like?

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:52.820
Y-Yuki Setsuna-chan...

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:58.450
But I just started to like her. So I think
I might be too forward to say that I like her.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:03.410
That's not true! It's never too early
or too late to like someone!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:04.670
Yes, exactly!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:08.710
Y-Yuki-san would also be very happy
to hear that someone likes her...

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:09.800
Definitely!

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.920
President, could it be...

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:17.050
...that you're also a Setsuna-chan fan, too?

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:18.260
Huh?

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:21.220
You were talking so passionately
about her, so I thought that you were.

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:24.520
I'm so happy to have
someone so likeminded nearby!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:28.810
--U-Um...
--Why don't we go to the concert together?

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:30.860
Cheers!

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:33.650
Thank goodness the application went through.

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:37.240
I'm glad everyone in the
student council agreed to this, too.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:39.740
It sounds like your vice
president is your fan,

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.740
but are you going to be able
to keep this from her?

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:46.580
I must work harder to remain
the mysterious school idol on campus.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.250
Right...

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:54.510
The girls from the Baking Club said they wanted
to help out with the festival somehow.

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.760
So did the Costumes and Accessories Club.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:02.010
The Basketball Club said they'd
help out with preparing the venues.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:05.350
It's the best that we have so many venues!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.940
I can't wait.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:09.980
Way to go, Yu-senpai!

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:12.610
Thanks, Yu-chan.

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:14.280
Oh, it's nothing.

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:22.530
Oh, I'm going to go buy us some drinks.

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:24.750
I'll go with you.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.540
Our festival is finally becoming a reality!

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:33.380
Yeah.

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:38.180
Yu-san seemed to work really hard
on that application.

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:40.430
Well, so did you.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:43.350
You two kept staying
really late after school.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:48.270
Oh, no. I did very little.

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:52.900
But... it's still something I can't do.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:54.320
Ayumu-san?

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:02.120
That day... The day of the training camp.

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:05.410
What were you and Yu-chan doing?

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:07.790
Yu-san and I?

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:13.210
Yeah. I saw you two
in the east building together.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:17.300
Oh! Yu-san was playing
piano in the music room,

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:19.430
so we had a little chat.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.430
Yu-chan was playing the piano?

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:28.270
Yes! She had gotten so much better
than the last time she played for me.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:31.810
It's always wonderful when you find
something new that you love.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:38.440
I didn't know that...

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:42.780
Is something the matter?

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.160
No, it's nothing.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:04.260
There's a part of Yu-<i>chan \</i>Nthat I don't know...

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.980
"Yu-chan"
"Can you come over right now?
I want to tell you something"

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.530
It's been a while since
you've been to my place.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.990
Yeah.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:29.700
Oh, this? I've been practicing it
for a little while now.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:32.040
I just can't seem to get any better, though.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:40.590
So hey, there's been something
I've been meaning to tell you.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:45.720
But I wasn't very confident, so I wanted to
tell you when I got a bit better,

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.430
then a lot of time had passed.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.020
You mean about the piano?

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:53.850
Huh? Well, yeah. There's that, too, but...

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:57.610
Then why did you tell Setsuna-chan about it?

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:01.740
You couldn't tell me,
but you told Setsuna-chan?

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:03.610
Wait, why is Setsuna-chan coming up?

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:05.780
Is Setsuna-chan more important to you?!

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:07.030
No.

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:18.540
What I wanted to tell you...

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:21.710
...is something further ahead.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:23.760
What?

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:25.090
You see, I have a dr--

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.970
--No!
--Ayumu?!

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.190
I don't want to hear it.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:40.480
Ayumu?

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:48.120
You said you'd see my dream through with me...
That you'd stay by my side...

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:55.040
I want to be a school idol
just for you, Yu-chan.

00:21:57.710 --> 00:21:59.290
So...

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:03.590
Please just belong to me.

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:22.570
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:22:22.570 --> 00:22:26.450
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:33.290
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:36.080
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:46.670
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:48.970
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:53.430
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:53.430 --> 00:23:01.520
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:05.900
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:08.990
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:13.490
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:16.120
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:19.370
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:22.540
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:27.840
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:32.050
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:39.140
Next time, "Blossoming Feelings."
